🔹 End-to-End GitOps Flow
A complete real-world setup looks like this:
GitHub → GitOps Tool → Kubernetes → Auto Deploy

Here’s how it works step by step:
1️⃣ Code & Config in GitHub
Application code and Kubernetes YAML stored in Git
Acts as the single source of truth
2️⃣ GitOps Tool Monitoring
GitOps tool continuously watches the repository
Detects any changes in configuration
3️⃣ Kubernetes Deployment
Changes are automatically applied to the cluster
Deployment, services, and updates handled
4️⃣ Auto Deployment
No manual steps required
System stays always in sync with Git

🔹 Example Real Project Idea
Deploy a sample web application
